{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0438f25d0869dad62d8bb5fa77d2cb8c563524aee003394ec651f763470f10b",
      "text": "唔——，接下来，\n记得是在练习室……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fcd7dfaa47dd222b1ac42b275430b9f17a172139507c27e0a25361da998f28",
      "text": "好久不见了！男极的工作人员\n最近一直在叹气说都见不到您呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84c1ddf02f75a936082f53849f7a2d6f98ce6f71cd7ab8bde7def7d7865cadea",
      "text": "毕竟您既要主办男极，又要兼顾平时的工作，\n确实是很忙碌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6534db3641abc2bab7b4b6ea8afdcb131778659f9e3213c689bc39ac5220757a",
      "text": "是啊……真的很忙啊。本来\n像这样停下脚步的时间都是没有的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71382d4598669670b090bc95da6c3fb798bf1e0bfbff5c2501d73862462c6ac2",
      "text": "对、对不起呢。冒昧跟您搭话，\n实在抱歉……那先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:318f15a763311c1eaad29dbecd1664d53e64a8bd174e9977d766404361d80101",
      "text": "（嘿——。那个人就是男极的大人物啊！\n不过，看起来像个坏心眼的家伙呢——）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4337bd0e3e18b748bccf5d05e0c0c5dc8242b5350b42946cc8de0f8bd208c85a",
      "text": "可恶，什么男极啊。不管怎么从中作梗，\n弱小事务所每次都那么神气……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e77e27dceefa7fa3fda5382f529e322cbe67822c7230022ea7af1e82e95e704c",
      "text": "托他们的福，我们自己的事务所完全没出上风头\n不是吗！这样搞下去简直成了彻底的失败企划。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85d71f6a41c9ca2633db537ae81022e93944af1a41e12d50e5b09d452c92d43e",
      "text": "之后会发生什么也说不准。\n总之我得先把退路准备好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce27d01c2622accb31ac8494df52ebf9728edfeea47b4d2c9311d412e7e8eea2",
      "text": "（……！什么嘛，那种话……\n大家为了这次比赛都在拼命努力啊。不可饶恕！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f313c5f2ef56d1060d86666262847ebd94f1059ba4fd6795ea7180a816ec15",
      "text": "喂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab29481a24e06bfc09df0e3343f6a66b9f0348ede6e9f45be2db3f03a4e49b2",
      "text": "嗯？你是……哪来的小鬼。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
